    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike English, the adjective usually goes after the noun: **o cameră mică** («a small room»). It changes to agree with the noun: **un dormitor mic**, **o cameră mică**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms",
     "texto": [
      "Some adjectives have different forms: **alb, albă, albi, albe** («white», in the masculine singular, feminine singular, masculine plural and feminine plural forms). **Mare** means «big» for masculine and feminine singular; in the plural it changes to **mari**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
